cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "An Auditable Aerobic Fermentor Simulator Tool for kₗa Determination and AI-Integrated Transport Phenomena Education"
abstract: >-
  An interactive Gradio web application designed for teaching transport
  phenomena in bioprocess engineering. The simulator performs kLa
  determination by the dynamic method and simulates full aerobic
  fermentation with coupled biomass, substrate, and dissolved oxygen
  dynamics. Beyond its computational use, the simulator is designed as
  an audit target: it embeds several undeclared assumptions that
  students must discover through code inspection with AI assistance
  and by contrasting the model against experimental datasets.
